    <p>Nothing on the site is a written estimate, a diagnosis, a warranty, or an agreement to repair a particular truck. Price, parts, time, and whether the shop accepts the job are confirmed by the shop, usually by phone, and then on a repair order or other written authorization. That repair order, and Nevada law that applies to vehicle repair, govern the work. These website terms do not change rights you cannot waive under that law.</p>
    <p>The service-area map is a picture of about 100 miles around the shop, with example drive times for Las Vegas, Henderson, North Las Vegas, Boulder City, and Pahrump. It is not a promise that the shop will travel to every point inside the circle, or that a listed drive time will be the time on the day you call. Roadside coverage on I-15, US-95, and US-93 is arranged by phone with the dispatcher.</p>

